{"info": {"address1": "Jain Plastic Park", "address2": "NH No. 6 Bambhori P.O. Box: 72", "city": "Jalgaon", "zip": "425001", "country": "India", "phone": "91 25 7225 8011", "fax": "91 25 7225 8111", "website": "https://www.jains.com", "industry": "Conglomerates", "industryKey": "conglomerates", "industryDisp": "Conglomerates", "sector": "Industrials", "sectorKey": "industrials", "sectorDisp": "Industrials", "longBusinessSummary": "Jain Irrigation Systems Limited manufactures and sells micro-irrigation systems in India, Europe, North America, and internationally. The company operates through Hi-Tech Agri Input Products, Plastic, Agro Processing, and Other Business segments. It provides drip irrigation; micro and mini sprinklers; sprinkler irrigation systems; hose reel and boom irrigation; filters, dosing pumps, and injectors; PVC and HDPE pipes and fittings; plastic sheets; hi-tech planting material; environment-controlled agriculture; polypropylene piping products; and plumbing and drainage systems. The company also offers green energy products, including solar photovoltaic (PV) modules, solar pumps, solar off grid power plants, solar rooftop grid connected plants, solar water heating systems, LED based home and street lighting products, LED lanterns, and module mounting structure solutions, as well as undertakes turnkey projects. In addition, it is involved in the fruit, vegetable, and spice processing activities; provision of dehydrated onion and vegetable products, aseptic fruit purees, concentrates, clarified juices, individually quick frozen, and frozen products under the Jain Farm Fresh brand; manufacture of fruit or vegetable juices and their concentrate squashes, powder, and spices; and manufactures and supplies tissue cultured plants and agriculture equipment and inputs. Further, the company engages in distribution of food ingredients, dehydrated onions, and other vegetables; and generates power through solar and biogas power plants. Additionally, the company manufactures and sells plastic sheets; and engages in the food and frozen foods business. The company was founded in 1963 and is headquartered in Jalgaon, India.", "companyOfficers": [{"maxAge": 1, "name": "Mr. Ashok Bhavarlal Jain B. Com, B.Com.", "age": 73, "title": "Executive Chairman", "yearBorn": 1952, "fiscalYear": 2025, "totalPay": 26907425, "exercisedValue": 0, "unexercisedValue": 0}, {"maxAge": 1, "name": "Mr. Anil Bhavarlal Jain B.Com., LLB", "age": 60, "title": "Vice Chairman, MD & CEO", "yearBorn": 1965, "fiscalYear": 2025, "totalPay": 26907425, "exercisedValue": 0, "unexercisedValue": 0}, {"maxAge": 1, "name": "Mr. Atul Bhavarlal Jain B. Com", "age": 56, "title": "Joint MD & Executive Director", "yearBorn": 1969, "fiscalYear": 2025, "totalPay": 26907425, "exercisedValue": 0, "unexercisedValue": 0}, {"maxAge": 1, "name": "Mr. Bipeen Yashwant Valame", "age": 56, "title": "Chief Financial Officer", "yearBorn": 1969, "fiscalYear": 2025, "exercisedValue": 0, "unexercisedValue": 0}, {"maxAge": 1, "name": "Mr. Avdhut Vasant Ghodgaonkar", "title": "Company Secretary & Chief Compliance Officer", "fiscalYear": 2025, "exercisedValue": 0, "unexercisedValue": 0}, {"maxAge": 1, "name": "Pradeep Sudhakar Naik", "title": "Senior Vice President of Human Resource Development", "fiscalYear": 2025, "exercisedValue": 0, "unexercisedValue": 0}, {"maxAge": 1, "name": "Mr. Ajit Bhavarlal Jain BE. (Mech)", "age": 59, "title": "Joint MD & Executive Director", "yearBorn": 1966, "fiscalYear": 2025, "totalPay": 26907425, "exercisedValue": 0, "unexercisedValue": 0}, {"maxAge": 1, "name": "Mr. Abhay Kantilal Jain B. Com", "title": "President of Sales Domestic - Maharashtra", "fiscalYear": 2025, "exercisedValue": 0, "unexercisedValue": 0}, {"maxAge": 1, "name": "Mr. Anilkumar  Kataria", "title": "President of Sales Domestic (South)", "fiscalYear": 2025, "exercisedValue": 0, "unexercisedValue": 0}, {"maxAge": 1, "name": "Mr. Vijay Loknath Samdani", "title": "Senior Vice President of